  "prefLabel": "Emp 209.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Emp 209.01 Purpose. The purpose of this part is to provide a uniform procedure for the conduct of public hearings at which comment from the general public will be solicited for evaluation and consideration by the department relative to rulemaking.\n\nSource. #10056, eff 12-20-11",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/emp100-500.html"
